{"id":"enseigne","lemma":"enseigne","pos":"noun","rank":2421,"glosses":["shop sign","any chain store that operates under a shop brand","suit"],"ipa":"/ɑ̃.sɛɲ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/2d/Fr-enseigne.ogg/Fr-enseigne.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"enseignes"},"formAudio":{"enseignes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4e/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-enseignes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Qui vous enseigne le français ?","en":"Who teaches you French?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/472073","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"French"}]},{"text":"Regarde l'enseigne juste derrière toi.","en":"Look at the sign just ahead of you.","words":[{"g":"to look at","l":"regarder"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"fair, just"},{"g":"behind"},{"g":"you"}]},{"text":"J'enseigne ici.","en":"I teach here.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Il enseigne l'anglais.","en":"He teaches English.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/12359","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"English"}]},{"text":"Je n'enseigne plus le français.","en":"I no longer teach French.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"French"}]}]}